  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Special Support to Vulnerable Families Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will provide complementary assistance to a target population of eight Syrian refugee families (46 individuals) residing in Azraq Camp and 3 additional family members residing abroad. Cash assistance, in line with standard amounts defined by partner organizations, will be provided to support vulnerable families to cover their basic needs. IOM will also provide health care assistance, including primary, secondary, dental and mental health and psychosocial support, as feasible to provide under current circumstances.</narrative>
  </description>
